{"3899140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prison Out", "steam_appid": 3899140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Prison Out』 is a game where the objective is to escape from a prison using 3D action and a physics engine. To escape from the prison, you must sneak past the guards, get the key, and escape from the prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he asks the devil for help in escaping from prison, he is turned into a teddy bear, but it is up to him whether he goes to defeat the devil to return him to normal, or whether he just runs away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you manage to escape from the cell, guards will be wandering around, so you'll need to hide and find the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/af275efc36a9a9157ad491c532f10493.poster.avif?t=1756037362\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/af275efc36a9a9157ad491c532f10493.webm?t=1756037362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/af275efc36a9a9157ad491c532f10493.mp4?t=1756037362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also progress easily by using the powers you gain from demons to escape or defeat the guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/fcd9f64df3651677b92cf61ef856c9eb.poster.avif?t=1756037362\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/fcd9f64df3651677b92cf61ef856c9eb.webm?t=1756037362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/fcd9f64df3651677b92cf61ef856c9eb.mp4?t=1756037362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Prison Out』 is a game where the objective is to escape from a prison using 3D action and a physics engine. To escape from the prison, you must sneak past the guards, get the key, and escape from the prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he asks the devil for help in escaping from prison, he is turned into a teddy bear, but it is up to him whether he goes to defeat the devil to return him to normal, or whether he just runs away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you manage to escape from the cell, guards will be wandering around, so you'll need to hide and find the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/af275efc36a9a9157ad491c532f10493.poster.avif?t=1756037362\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/af275efc36a9a9157ad491c532f10493.webm?t=1756037362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899140/extras/af275efc36a9a9157ad491c532f10493.mp4?t=1756037362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also progress easily by using the powers you gain from demons to escape or defeat the guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap